<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY ONE-MONTH T-BILL YIELD DROPS TO 20.92 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY ONE-MONTH T-BILL YIELD DROPS TO 20.92 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the</p>
<p>latest issue of Hungary's one-month discount Treasury bills was</p>
<p>set by auction at 20.92 percent, down from 21.20 percent at</p>
<p>auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency</p>
<p>said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	3,665.27 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.92 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.4205 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
